 {"id": 7, "region": "asia"}}, {"id": 495483, "date": 1686009600, "platform": 48, "y": 2023, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 738302, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scftoe.jpg"}, {"id": 738301, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scftod.jpg"}, {"id": 738304, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scftog.jpg"}, {"id": 738303, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scftof.jpg"}], "slug": "loop8-summer-of-gods", "storyline": "After the Kegai forced humanity to the brink of extinction, the survivors fled to the stars. Raised on a failed space station known as the \u2018Hope\u2019, high school student Nini returns to Earth to spend his summer in the rural Japanese town of Ashihara, one of humanity\u2019s last remaining sanctuaries. Though Ashihara remains relatively untouched, the Kegai are still a threatening presence, and it is only a matter of time before they break through the divine barrier protecting the town.\nGifted with the Demon Sight, an ability that allows him to see into the \u2018Underworld\u2019 where the Kegai lurk, Nini might be humanity\u2019s last best chance of survival. He can\u2019t do it alone, however, and he\u2019ll need to befriend his classmates if he has any hope of fending off this ancient threat.", "summary": "In this original coming-of-age RPG, step into the life of Nini, a newly earthbound teen who arrives in the quaint Japanese town of Ashihara in August 1983. Explore the town, befriend its people, and face off against the Kegai in turn-based battles where the outcomes depend on the relationships you\u2019ve built and the decisions you\u2019ve made. Use Nini\u2019s special connection to the gods to reset the world, with each loop allowing Nini and his allies to relive the 8th month over and over until they get it right\u2026or the Kegai overcome them entirely.\nWith one month until the world ends, how will you spend each day?", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/loop8-summer-of-gods", "videos": [{"id": 64198, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "UymVi2gb6n0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UymVi2gb6n0", "title": "LOOP8\uff08\u30eb\u30fc\u30d7\u30a8\u30a4\u30c8\uff09 [Nintendo Direct 2022.2.10]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UymVi2gb6n0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 64200, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "GlEPE2ohdKI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GlEPE2ohdKI", "title": "\u300eLOOP8\uff08\u30eb\u30fc\u30d7\u30a8\u30a4\u30c8\uff09\u300f1st\u30c8\u30ec\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GlEPE2ohdKI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 85566, "name": "Game Intro", "video_id": "VqMn32v_KzA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VqMn32v_KzA", "title": "Loop8: Summer of Gods - Opening Movie", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VqMn32v_KzA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 80400, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "finmUKkiSOY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=finmUKkiSOY", "title": "Loop8: Summer of Gods - Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/finmUKkiSOY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 90412, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "aClnJF9tCRw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aClnJF9tCRw", "title": "Loop8: Summer of Gods | Locales Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/aClnJF9tCRw/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}